<section id="method" data-8b-section="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
  <div class="method__head">
    <h2 class="m-text-3" id="method-title" data-8b-motion="rise">How we work<span class="m-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
    <p class="m-text-5 method__lead" data-8b-motion="ink">Every project follows a proven, customer-focused consulting loop built for measurable impact and sustained growth.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="method__body">
    <div class="method__ring" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="method__svg" viewBox="0 0 400 400"><circle class="method__track" cx="200" cy="200" r="170"/><circle class="method__arc" cx="200" cy="200" r="170" pathLength="1" stroke-dasharray="1 1" stroke-dashoffset="0"/></svg>
      <span class="method__station" style="--x:0;--y:-1"></span>
      <span class="method__station" style="--x:1;--y:0"></span>
      <span class="method__station" style="--x:0;--y:1"></span>
      <span class="method__station" style="--x:-1;--y:0"></span>
      <span class="method__arm"><span class="method__runner"></span></span>
    </div>
    <ol class="method__steps">
      <li class="step"><h3 class="m-text-4">Listen &amp; Discover</h3><p class="m-text-5 step__text">We analyze your market, customer data, and current digital funnel before designing strategies.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><h3 class="m-text-4">Strategize &amp; Build</h3><p class="m-text-5 step__text">Collaborative design and engineering of high-performing campaigns, websites, and brand assets.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><h3 class="m-text-4">Deploy &amp; Measure</h3><p class="m-text-5 step__text">We launch campaigns, track KPIs transparently, and evaluate real business impact against agreed goals.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><h3 class="m-text-4">Optimize &amp; Scale</h3><p class="m-text-5 step__text">Continuous refinement, conversion rate optimization, and scaling what delivers the highest ROI.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="studio" data-8b-section="studio" aria-labelledby="studio-title">
