          <li class="m-card"><p class="voices__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.2l2 4.3 4.7.5-3.5 3.2 1 4.6L8 11.4l-4.2 2.4 1-4.6L1.3 6l4.7-.5z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.2l2 4.3 4.7.5-3.5 3.2 1 4.6L8 11.4l-4.2 2.4 1-4.6L1.3 6l4.7-.5z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.2l2 4.3 4.7.5-3.5 3.2 1 4.6L8 11.4l-4.2 2.4 1-4.6L1.3 6l4.7-.5z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.2l2 4.3 4.7.5-3.5 3.2 1 4.6L8 11.4l-4.2 2.4 1-4.6L1.3 6l4.7-.5z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.2l2 4.3 4.7.5-3.5 3.2 1 4.6L8 11.4l-4.2 2.4 1-4.6L1.3 6l4.7-.5z"/></svg></p><p class="m-text">Transparent reporting and prompt communication. We always know exactly how our budget is performing.</p><p class="m-text-6">Sneha Mehta, Marketing Head</p></li>
