          <p class="setup__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9.5"/></svg>Growth Roadmap</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="setup__card" style="--setup-i:1">
        <p class="setup__num m-text-2" aria-hidden="true">1</p>
        <div class="setup__copy"><h3 class="m-text-5">Custom Growth Plan</h3><p class="m-text-8">We engineer a tailored digital strategy spanning SEO, paid ads, website optimization, and content designed to achieve your specific KPIs.</p></div>
