</section>
<section class="faq" id="faq" data-8b-section="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="faq__sheet m-band" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="faq__inner l-wrap">
    <div class="faq__head">
      <h2 class="m-text-3" id="faq-title" data-8b-motion="captionIn">Questions, answered plainly.</h2>
      <p class="m-text-8">Still wondering about something? <a class="m-link" href="#contact">Ask a person</a> — we reply within a day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">What services does Better Insights provide?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">We provide comprehensive digital marketing and consulting services, including Web Design, Google &amp; Meta Ads, SEO, Social Media Marketing, Public Relations, and Branding.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">How do you measure project success and ROI?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">We establish clear, measurable KPIs prior to launch—including qualified lead volume, conversion rate, cost per acquisition, and organic search ranking growth—tracked through real-time dashboards.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">What industries does Better Insights work with?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">We have deep consulting and execution experience across Education, Healthcare, Manufacturing, Digital Commerce, Legal, Real Estate, and Technology sectors.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">How does the onboarding and collaboration process work?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">We begin with an in-depth discovery audit, provide a transparent roadmap and deliverables schedule, communicate through dedicated channels, and provide regular performance reviews.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">Who owns our campaign data and accounts?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">You retain 100% ownership over all advertising accounts, analytics dashboards, website code, and creative assets. We believe in complete transparency and data sovereignty.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">Can you help us scale into international markets?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">Yes. We manage multi-region campaigns and international SEO architectures helping brands expand across India, the Middle East, Europe, and the United States.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">What is the typical timeframe to see results?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">Paid advertising and landing page optimizations typically drive leads within the first two weeks, while technical SEO and organic ranking strategies show strong compounded growth within 60 to 90 days.</p></details>
      <details class="faq__item"><summary class="m-text-5">How can my brand get started with a marketing plan?<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p class="m-text">Reach out through our contact form, email contact@betterinsights.in, or call +91 950 999 6730. Our team will review your business needs and provide a tailored marketing plan within 24 hours.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
